@page "/games"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "一起玩";
    ViewData["ActiveNav"] = "games";
    ViewData["Bundle"] = "games";
}
<main id="main" class="games-page">
    <header class="games-heading">
        <p class="games-eyebrow">A LITTLE PLAYTIME</p>
        <h1>今天，一起玩什么？</h1>
        <p>把忙碌放一放，留一点时间，和喜欢的人较量一下。</p>
    </header>
    <section class="games-grid" aria-label="选择小游戏">
        <a class="game-card" href="/games/gomoku">
            <div class="game-preview" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="mini-board"><i class="stone-black s1"></i><i class="stone-white s2"></i><i class="stone-black s3"></i><i class="stone-white s4"></i><i class="stone-black s5"></i></div>
                <span class="game-badge">经典棋类 · 在线双人</span>
            </div>
            <div class="game-card-body">
                <p class="games-eyebrow">01 / GOMOKU</p>
                <h2>五子棋</h2>
                <p>一人一色，轮流落子。先把五颗棋子连成一线，就赢下这一局。</p>
                <div class="game-card-footer"><span>@Icon("lock") 情侣专属对局</span><strong>开始下棋 @Icon("arrow-right")</strong></div>
            </div>
        </a>
    </section>
    <p class="games-footnote">双方登录各自账号，即可在不同设备上一起玩。</p>
</main>
